# Walkthrough - Lesson Management Feature

I have successfully implemented the Lesson Management feature, allowing instructors to build and manage course curricula efficiently within the SkillPilot platform.

## Key Accomplishments

### 1. Advanced Curriculum Builder
I've integrated a powerful curriculum builder into the Course Studio. Instructors can now:
- Create sections using a sleek, inline input field (replacing unreliable browser prompts).
- Add lessons (Video, PDF, or Text) to any section.
- Upload video and PDF files or provide external URLs for video content.

### 2. Premium & Responsive UI
The Lesson Form Modal has been significantly enhanced:
- **Responsive Design**: Adapts seamlessly to all screen sizes.
- **Scrollable Content**: Ensures all form fields and actions remain accessible even on small viewports.
- **Micro-animations**: Added subtle transitions for a high-end, interactive feel.
- **Custom Scrollbar**: Standardized scrollbar styling for a consistent brand experience.

### 3. Role-Based Access & Branding
- **Correct Role Display**: Fixed the logic in the dashboard header to correctly show the user's role (e.g., "Instructor" instead of "Student").
- **Branding Cleanup**: Completely removed all legacy "mponline" references project-wide, standardizing on neutral domains like "skillpilot.io".

