## Technical Summary
- **Backend**: Updated [CourseController](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Courses/app/Http/Controllers/CourseController.php#10-97) and [LessonController](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Lessons/app/Http/Controllers/LessonController.php#10-106) to handle nested curriculum data and file storage.
- **Frontend**: Overhauled [EditCoursePage](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-frontend/src/app/%28dashboard%29/instructor/courses/%5Bid%5D/edit/page.tsx#47-434) and [LessonFormModal](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-frontend/src/components/instructor/courses/LessonFormModal.tsx#37-246) with modern React patterns and Tailwind CSS.
- **UX**: Replaced `window.prompt` with custom inline UI components for better stability and beauty.
